HST Office: the ribbon collapse ladder follows each tab's own order.

When vcl/inc/HstRibbonLadders.hxx (generated, hst-ribbon-scale-ladders.patch) has a ladder for exactly
the groups of a merged group box, its steps come first (low-value groups shrink first, core groups and
Styles last), followed by the default ladder for anything it leaves out, and groups fold into the
chevron popup in its fold order instead of strictly from the right. Without the header, or for other
boxes, the default ladder and right-to-left folding stay.

- vcl/source/control/PriorityMergedHBox.cxx, vcl/inc/PriorityMergedHBox.hxx.

